 Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-27T16:46:39-07:00","id":1415756,"title":"","content":"I think the Baali are a cool concept but I wouldn\u2019t want one in my coterie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T01:14:20-07:00","id":1415786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1414571-the-morality-thread-how-evil-are-your-kindred?p=1415700#post1415700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Sense the Sin is too powerful for a level 1 Discipline. My character wouldn\u2019t want some random neonate being able to know her deepest secrets.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, so does Dementation 3, which is also chargen-reachable. And for that matter, so does being a thin-blood seer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T06:03:18-07:00","id":1415806,"title":"","content":"Yes, but it should be level 3 or 4.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T06:11:53-07:00","id":1415809,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1414571-the-morality-thread-how-evil-are-your-kindred?p=1415806#post1415806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, but it should be level 3 or 4.</div> </div> </div> </div>why? you want them to suck like the toreador?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T07:26:36-07:00","id":1415823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1414571-the-morality-thread-how-evil-are-your-kindred?p=1415756#post1415756\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the Baali are a cool concept but I wouldn\u2019t want one in my coterie.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The key to any successful Chaotic Evil character is to pretend to be Any Good.<br /> <br /> (Diamonion in V20 sucks shit from 2-5. I think the first power is delightful and worth 10xp)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I played a Baali once for DAV20; She was on the road of sin, hot as hell, and pretended to be Toreador. I made a few False steps in pretending to be a toreador (I had never played a toreador, so that might be why), but it mostly worked. Then again I would just occasionally indulge in some maliciousness for kicks, I wasn't dedicating myself to the mighty BEPHERASPHARON and serving in his name for his glory.<br /> <br /> I suppose if someone played a more 'traditional' Baali with the corpse well and such it'd be a bit of a kicker for the Coterie (unless they were an all-baali coterie...) </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T09:07:20-07:00","id":1415835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1414571-the-morality-thread-how-evil-are-your-kindred?p=1415823#post1415823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The key to any successful Chaotic Evil character is to pretend to be Any Good.<br /> <br /> (Diamonion in V20 sucks shit from 2-5. I think the first power is delightful and worth 10xp)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I played a Baali once for DAV20; She was on the road of sin, hot as hell, and pretended to be Toreador. I made a few False steps in pretending to be a toreador (I had never played a toreador, so that might be why), but it mostly worked. Then again I would just occasionally indulge in some maliciousness for kicks, I wasn't dedicating myself to the mighty BEPHERASPHARON and serving in his name for his glory.<br /> <br /> I suppose if someone played a more 'traditional' Baali with the corpse well and such it'd be a bit of a kicker for the Coterie (unless they were an all-baali coterie...) </span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>I agree. It is a very cool power. It just shouldn\u2019t be a level 1 power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-28T10:40:02-07:00","id":1415850,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1414571-the-morality-thread-how-evil-are-your-kindred?p=1415823#post1415823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Diamonion in V20 sucks shit from 2-5. I think the first power is delightful and worth 10xp)</div> </div> </div> </div>You w0t m8te?<br /> Daimoinon 2 is easily as good as Dementation 4. It's an excellent power for non-lethal incapacitation of any enemy, and gets past any fancy soak pools the person might have.<br /> Daimoinon 3 isn't the best source of damage in the game, but it's based on Occult, so you can be a bit less MAD with your skills. And it's great for stealth attacks, because you can sit in the corner and kamehameha for a few turns.<br /> Daimoinon 4 I've never seen used and it honestly seems like a pain in the ass. But throwing an extra combatant into the mix seems decent, and it's excellent for assassinations.<br /> Daimoinon 5 is one of the most amazing powers out there. Free-form curses, at no cost, with variable potency and duration. It's the single best debuff in the game. Forget about necromancy, forget about dementation, forget about presence. Slap this bad boy on a person, and have them crippled in whichever way you want. Good luck fighting your coterie when every failed roll the enemy makes turns into a botch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12892-kammerer","name":"Kammerer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12892_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1191"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}